WEBVTT

00:05:58.442 --> 00:06:00.398
It was much, much better.

00:06:01.181 --> 00:06:05.446
I knew that this technology would change
the entire field of archaeology

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.099
in the coming years,

00:06:07.123 --> 00:06:08.424
and it did.

00:06:10.376 --> 00:06:13.432
Our work came to the attention
of a group of filmmakers

00:06:13.456 --> 00:06:16.361
who were searching for a legendary
lost city in Honduras.

00:06:16.965 --> 00:06:18.352
They failed in their quest,

00:06:18.376 --> 00:06:21.959
but they instead documented
an unknown culture,

00:06:21.983 --> 00:06:26.331
now buried under a pristine
wilderness rain forest,

00:06:26.355 --> 00:06:27.710
using LiDAR.

00:06:28.789 --> 00:06:30.643
I agreed to help interpret their data,